WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.359
Long posting?
Break it down.

2
00:00:02.359 --> 00:00:06.253
AI splits it into the work, the stack,
the years and the soft skills,

3
00:00:06.253 --> 00:00:07.760
each marked must or nice.

4
00:00:08.825 --> 00:00:11.628
Then Job Radar checks it
against your skills, locally.

5
00:00:11.628 --> 00:00:14.965
Six of nine must-haves,
and a short list to build up.

6
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:17.641
Every item quotes the posting.

7
00:00:17.641 --> 00:00:20.690
If the quote isn't really
there, the item is dropped.
